  Text: 'This Asset creates a progress bar that decreases continuously or by segments. You can choose from available designs in the "prefabs" folder or create your own. To use, call the "damageEvent" function from another script, passing an integer damage amount. To increase life, call the healEvent function with an integer heal amount.   Refer to the "documentation.js" file for more information.'
